# GMS: a 10+4x% chance of one meso on every attack, over 5 levels, up to 15 on
# the ground. Here ten levels at 2% each, reaching GMS's 30%.
#
# The roll is per LINE the swing lands. GMS never says so, but four coins from
# one monster in one attack can't happen any other way, and it is what makes the
# pair worth its thirty points.
#
# A meso's value isn't modelled, and GMS doesn't state one either: its own hyper
# raises the chance and the count, never the value. A meso is ammunition for
# Meso Explosion.
name: "Pick Pocket"
description: "Causes Mesos to drop when you attack with your skills."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CHIEF_BANDIT skill_order: 4 }
max_level: 10
base { meso_drop_chance: 0.12 }
per_level { meso_drop_chance: 0.02 }
